const faq = [
  { q: 'How long does Meta App Review take?', a: "Meta's App Review page gives no review time. Siar's took 13 days: submitted on 14 October 2026, approved on 27 October 2026 with all 27 permissions, after one resubmission that same day. Most of the work came before submitting: business verification, a description and a film for each permission, and product fixes." },
  { q: 'Why was my Meta App Review rejected?', a: "Meta rejects the whole submission when its reviewer can't get into your app, and refuses a single permission when it can't see that permission in use. Check your reviewer login first. Then check each film: signed out at the start, the consent screen shown, and the feature visibly using the data." },
  { q: 'What are the Meta App Review video requirements?', a: "One screencast for each permission, at 1080p or better, with the app in English and no audio. Start logged out, show the full login and the person granting the permission, then show the feature using it. Add captions where the screen isn't self-explanatory, and record only your app with a bigger cursor." },
