  { q: 'Do I need my own Meta App Review if I use Siar?', a: "No, for Facebook, Instagram and Threads. Siar's Meta app passed App Review on 27 October 2026, so your customers connect through it. They sign in to Meta themselves through a connect link with your name and logo. Meta's own consent screen names Siar, because they are granting Siar's app." },
