  { q: "Does Siar's Meta approval cover TikTok, YouTube or LinkedIn?", a: `No. Each network runs its own gate. ${S.TIKTOK.line} ${S.YOUTUBE.line} ${S.LINKEDIN.line} Open today besides Meta: X, Bluesky, Mastodon, Discord and Slack.` },
  { q: 'Does App Review make Siar a partner of Meta?', a: "No. Siar's Meta app passed App Review on 27 October 2026, with all 27 permissions it asked for. That approves how one app uses Meta's data. It is not a partnership, and Siar is not affiliated with or endorsed by Meta. Siar is made by FF DEV STUDIO, a company registered in Malaysia." },
  { q: "What is Meta's Data Use Checkup?", a: "An annual check that an app's continued access to Meta data still follows Meta's Platform Terms and Developer Policies. Apps in Development mode don't need it; it must be done before an app goes Live. Siar completed its Data Use Checkup on 27 October 2026, the day its App Review passed." },
